<#5aaaff>HADOU CHARGE / DENJIN</>
Hadou charge (hold or tap)		^X
  Charges the Hadou gauge (bottom of the screen). A tap adds a
  little, holding fills it in about 1.2 seconds. Standing or
  crouching, not while he is in the air.
Gauge full
  Fireballs, Shoryuken and supers do 20% more damage.
Denjin (gauge full)		^X
  Ryu's aura flares for 10 seconds: fireballs, Shoryuken and
  supers do 40% more damage. The bar then shows the time left.

<#5aaaff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
  Works on the ground only.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U
Zero Counter (while blocking, 1 bar)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C

<#5aaaff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy punch		^A / ^B / ^C
  Close versions at short range.
  Gatling: on hit or block A > B > C (standing, crouching or in the air, upward only), and any
  normal that connects cancels into specials, EX moves and supers.
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Senpu Kyaku		_F^A
Sakotsu Wari (overhead)		_F^B
Kyubi Kudaki		_F^C

<#5aaaff>SPECIALS</>
  A = light, B = medium. C is the EX version (500 meter).
Hadoken		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Shakunetsu Hadoken		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Shoryuken		_F_D_DF^A / ^B
Tatsumaki Senpukyaku (also in the air)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B

<#5aaaff>EX MOVES (500 meter)</>
EX Hadoken (hits twice)		_D_DF_F^C
EX Shakunetsu Hadoken		_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
EX Shoryuken		_F_D_DF^C
EX Tatsumaki Senpukyaku (also in the air)		_D_DB_B^C

<#5aaaff>SUPERS</>
Shinku Hadoken (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Denjin Hadoken (1 bar, hold the button to charge)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Shin Shoryuken (5 bars)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F two of ^A / ^B / ^C
